# pebbles doctor

`pebbles doctor` reports divergence between .pebbles/index.json and
.pebbles/issues/ without touching the store (the repair half is `pebbles
reindex`, SPEC r[reindex]). Each fixture store below is addressed through
`PEBBLES_DB_PATH`: a consistent store, an orphaned-file store, a
missing-file store, a mixed store (mismatch + unknown + orphaned in one),
and a store whose index is unparsable.

## A consistent store is a one-line clean bill of health (exit 0)

```console
$ PEBBLES_DB_PATH=consistent/.pebbles pebbles doctor
✓ Store is consistent: 2 indexed issue(s); every issue file and index entry match.

```

## Orphaned files: issue files on disk the index does not map

The repo's historical test-pollution files land here. Both strays are
reported by name, sorted; one parses as an issue, one is junk - doctor
only checks whether the file is indexed, never parses orphans.

```console
$ PEBBLES_DB_PATH=orphaned/.pebbles pebbles doctor
? failed
✗ Found 2 divergence(s) between .pebbles/index.json and .pebbles/issues/:
orphaned (2):
  stray-test-pollution.json (file not in index)
  zz-backup-copy.json (file not in index)

```

## Missing files: index entries whose file is not on disk

```console
$ PEBBLES_DB_PATH=missing/.pebbles pebbles doctor
? failed
✗ Found 1 divergence(s) between .pebbles/index.json and .pebbles/issues/:
missing (1):
  uc-33333333-export-csv.json (index entry 33333333-1111-1111-1111-111111111111, file not on disk)

```

## Mixed divergences in one store, grouped per class

The jwt entry's file parses as an issue declaring a different id
(mismatch), the broken entry's file does not parse as an issue (unknown),
and a stray file is orphaned. Class blocks appear in fixed order, files
within a block sorted by name.

```console
$ PEBBLES_DB_PATH=mixed/.pebbles pebbles doctor
? failed
✗ Found 3 divergence(s) between .pebbles/index.json and .pebbles/issues/:
orphaned (1):
  zz-stray.json (file not in index)
unknown (1):
  broken-44444444-x.json (index entry 44444444-1111-1111-1111-111111111111, file does not parse as an issue)
mismatch (1):
  bug-22222222-jwt-auth.json (index id 22222222-1111-1111-1111-111111111111, file declares 55555555-1111-1111-1111-111111111111)

```

## An unparsable index is a store-level unknown

An index entry whose id is not a UUID (or malformed index JSON) makes the
whole index unreadable; doctor reports it as an unknown on index.json and
stops, pointing at `pebbles reindex` as the repair.

```console
$ PEBBLES_DB_PATH=bad-index/.pebbles pebbles doctor
? failed
✗ Found 1 divergence(s) between .pebbles/index.json and .pebbles/issues/:
unknown (1):
  index.json (the index does not parse: Failed to parse index file; run 'pebbles reindex' to rebuild)

```
